function parlayMath(){if(legs.length<2)return null;const picks=legs.map(legFor);const kind=legKind(legs[0]);const correlated=sameEvent(picks);const probabilities=legs.map(legProbability);if(probabilities.some(p=>p===null))return null;const p=probabilities.reduce((acc,p)=>acc*p,1);const fair=1/p;const offered=kind==='sportsbook'?picks.reduce((acc,d)=>acc*decimal(d.odds),1):(payoutOverride??defaultPayout(picks[0].book,legs.length));return {p,fair,offered,correlated,kind,ev:offered===null?null:(p*offered-1)*100}}
